 crx:{t:'Crexont',d:`Extended-release capsules: after a first peak at about 1 hour, levels hold for about 6 to 7 hours; fluctuation index about 1.7 against 2.7. Week-20 off-time 4.18 against 4.75 hours on immediate-release. <sup class="c" data-ref="LevodopaLabels2026" title="Source 190">190</sup>`},
 sc:{t:'Foslevodopa infusion under the skin',d:`A 24-hour infusion from a small pump. It bypasses the gut, so food does not change absorption. <sup class="c" data-ref="LevodopaLabels2026" title="Source 190">190</sup> Against oral levodopa: good on-time +1.75 hours and off-time −1.79 hours a day. <sup class="c" data-ref="Soileau2022" title="Source 341">341</sup>`},
