 meal:{t:'Protein-rich lunch',d:`Meals cut the peak by 29% and delayed absorption by 34 minutes in people with fluctuations; protein also competes at the blood-brain barrier, even with intravenous levodopa. <sup class="c" data-ref="Nutt1984" title="Source 249">249</sup> The model applies the oral delay only; infusion absorption is not changed by food. <sup class="c" data-ref="LevodopaLabels2026" title="Source 190">190</sup>`}
